<title>USA: Gartner Group Inc closes Datapro merger.</title>
<headline>Gartner Group Inc closes Datapro merger.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Technology adviser Gartner Group Inc said Tuesday it completed its acquisition of Datapro Information Services, a unit of McGraw-Hill Cos Inc, in a cash transaction.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Datapro, which offers hardware and software evaluations, is headquartered in New Jersey, with regional headquarters in the United Kingdom and Singapore.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
